  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Toxic players are unavoidable be they people shouting the n-word while running around a world or people with crasher avatars or clients with crashing abilities. Unfortunately banning might not be effective as they can just create new accounts and start the cycle all over again. My suggestion, if at all possible to implement, create a role or a strike on the account where if a player gets enough harassing/toxic behavior reports they’re forced to only go to worlds with other people who have the same strike/rank.\nMaybe forcing them to spend time with those who have the same bad attitudes and avatars will straighten them out and maybe make them appreciate the game and, dare I say, have fun with other people? It has the possibility for abuse and steps should be taken to prevent the possibility for it but any solution for quarantining(lmao) these types of players would be better than nothing.",
